{"issues":[{"expand":"renderedFields,names,schema,operations,editmeta,changelog,versionedRepresentations","id":"111546","self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/111546","key":"MC-239344","renderedFields":{"summary":null,"issuetype":null,"watches":null,"customfield_10070":null,"customfield_10061":"","created":"19/Oct/21 11:20 AM","customfield_10050":"","customfield_10051":null,"description":"<p>Note: This has been unreported for a long time and it's probably the real reason for \n    <span class=\"jira-issue-macro resolved\" data-jira-key=\"MC-216561\">\n                <a href=\"https://mojira.atlassian.net/browse/MC-216561\" class=\"jira-issue-macro-key issue-link\" title=\"Torches not spawning in abandoned mineshafts under y=0\">\n            <img class=\"icon\" src=\"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10303?size=medium\">\n            MC-216561\n        </a>\n                                                    <span class=\"aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-subtle aui-lozenge-success jira-macro-single-issue-export-pdf\">Resolved</span>\n            </span>\n as unless there happens to be a random block behind the torch it won't generate making torches rarer. Also could possibly be the reason for \n    <span class=\"jira-issue-macro resolved\" data-jira-key=\"MC-216432\">\n                <a href=\"https://mojira.atlassian.net/browse/MC-216432\" class=\"jira-issue-macro-key issue-link\" title=\"Mineshafts can generate with light but without any torches\">\n            <img class=\"icon\" src=\"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10303?size=medium\">\n            MC-216432\n        </a>\n                                                    <span class=\"aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-subtle aui-lozenge-success jira-macro-single-issue-export-pdf\">Resolved</span>\n            </span>\n</p>\n\n<p>Bug Description: This is probably a recurrence of \n    <span class=\"jira-issue-macro resolved\" data-jira-key=\"MC-124966\">\n                <a href=\"https://mojira.atlassian.net/browse/MC-124966\" class=\"jira-issue-macro-key issue-link\" title=\"Torches in mineshafts/strongholds are not always attached\">\n            <img class=\"icon\" src=\"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10303?size=medium\">\n            MC-124966\n        </a>\n                                                    <span class=\"aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-subtle aui-lozenge-success jira-macro-single-issue-export-pdf\">Resolved</span>\n            </span>\n, all torches in mineshafts are now facing the wrong way. This apart from being a bug in of itself probably makes torches rarer as those won't generate unless they happen to have a random supporting block generate. I also do not know the first version this started to occur in.</p>\n\n<p><b>Expected Behaviour:</b><br>\n All torches in mineshafts generate attached to the wooden support pillars<br>\n <span class=\"image-wrap\" style=\"\"><a id=\"147861_thumb\" href=\"/rest/api/3/attachment/content/147861\" title=\"Expected.png\" file-preview-type=\"image\" file-preview-id=\"147861\" file-preview-title=\"Expected.png\"><jira-attachment-thumbnail url=\"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/thumbnail/147861?default=false\" jira-url=\"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/thumbnail/147861\" filename=\"Expected.png\"><img src=\"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/thumbnail/147861\" data-attachment-name=\"Expected.png\" data-attachment-type=\"thumbnail\" data-media-services-id=\"f83b297b-90cc-4c69-a77f-ea6c5932a33a\" data-media-services-type=\"file\" style=\"border: 0px solid black\"></jira-attachment-thumbnail></a></span></p>\n\n<p><b>Observed Behaviour:</b><br>\n All torches generate rotated 180* in the other direction<br>\n<span class=\"image-wrap\" style=\"\"><a id=\"147862_thumb\" href=\"/rest/api/3/attachment/content/147862\" title=\"unexpected.png\" file-preview-type=\"image\" file-preview-id=\"147862\" file-preview-title=\"unexpected.png\"><jira-attachment-thumbnail url=\"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/thumbnail/147862?default=false\" jira-url=\"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/thumbnail/147862\" filename=\"unexpected.png\"><img src=\"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/thumbnail/147862\" data-attachment-name=\"unexpected.png\" data-attachment-type=\"thumbnail\" data-media-services-id=\"bf458a46-3f4a-4a75-836f-c7ce2e15230a\" data-media-services-type=\"file\" style=\"border: 0px solid black\"></jira-attachment-thumbnail></a></span><br>\n <b>How to reproduce:</b><br>\n Locate any mineshaft structure (it doesn't matter whether it's above or below y0) and find any torches you will find that all of them are rotated</p>","customfield_10054":null,"fixVersions":null,"customfield_10055":null,"resolution":null,"customfield_10047":"02/Nov/21 1:41 AM","customfield_10048":null,"labels":null,"customfield_10049":null,"attachment":[{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/147853","id":"147853","filename":"2021-10-19_19.59.07.png","author":{"avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png","24x24":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png","16x16":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png","32x32":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png"},"displayName":"Ceresjanin123","active":true,"timeZone":"Europe/Warsaw","accountType":"customer"},"created":"19/Oct/21 11:16 AM","size":"742 kB","mimeType":"image/png","content":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/content/147853","thumbnail":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/thumbnail/147853"},{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/